#: ../../content/support.md:5
msgid "Support and assistance"
msgstr "Support et assistance"

#: ../../content/support.md:8
msgid ""
"Contact LPLG support for Resthome, the software for nursing and care homes —"
" open a ticket, what information to include, and where to find help."
msgstr ""
"Contacter le support LPLG pour Resthome, le logiciel pour maisons de repos "
"et de soins — ouvrir un ticket, informations à joindre, où trouver de "
"l'aide."

#: ../../content/support.md:11
msgid ""
"A problem or a question about Resthome? Here is how to get help, from the "
"fastest to the most direct."
msgstr ""
"Un souci, une question sur Resthome ? Voici comment obtenir de l'aide, du "
"plus rapide au plus direct."

#: ../../content/support.md:14
msgid "1. Search the documentation first"
msgstr "1\\. Cherchez d'abord dans la documentation"

#: ../../content/support.md:16
msgid "Most answers are already here:"
msgstr "La plupart des réponses sont déjà ici :"

#: ../../content/support.md:18
msgid ""
"The **search** at the top of the page (magnifying glass icon): type a "
"keyword, an error **code** or an error message."
msgstr ""
"La **recherche** en haut de page (icône loupe) : tapez un mot-clé, un "
"**code** d'erreur ou un message d'erreur."

#: ../../content/support.md:20
msgid "The [FAQ](faq.md) and the [Glossary](glossaire.md)."
msgstr "La [FAQ](faq.md) et le [Glossaire](glossaire.md)."

#: ../../content/support.md:21
msgid ""
"The topic guides: [residents](residents/index.md), "
"[billing](facturation/index.md), [care](soins/index.md)."
msgstr ""
"Les guides par thème : [habitants](residents/index.md), "
"[facturation](facturation/index.md), [soins](soins/index.md)."

#: ../../content/support.md:23
msgid ""
"Your country's space, chosen with the **country selector** at the top of the"
" page."
msgstr ""
"L'espace de votre pays, choisi avec le **sélecteur de pays** en haut de la "
"page."

#: ../../content/support.md:26
msgid "In Belgium"
msgstr "En Belgique"

#: ../../content/support.md:29
msgid ""
"Search for a Belgian code as is (e.g. \"931\", \"MDA\"). The eHealth guides "
"— [eFact](belgique/ehealth/efact.md), [insurability "
"(MDA)](belgique/ehealth/mda.md), [agreements "
"(eAgreement)](belgique/ehealth/eagreement.md) — and the troubleshooting "
"pages resolve most common cases: [eFact rejections](belgique/ehealth/efact-"
"rejets.md), [MDA errors](belgique/ehealth/mda-erreurs.md), [Agreement "
"refused](belgique/ehealth/eagreement-refus.md). See also the [FAQ — "
"Belgium](belgique/faq.md)."
msgstr ""
"Cherchez un code belge tel quel (par ex. « 931 », « MDA »). Les guides "
"eHealth — [eFact](belgique/ehealth/efact.md), [assurabilité "
"(MDA)](belgique/ehealth/mda.md), [accords "
"(eAgreement)](belgique/ehealth/eagreement.md) — et les pages de dépannage "
"règlent la majorité des cas courants : [Rejets "
"eFact](belgique/ehealth/efact-rejets.md), [Erreurs "
"MDA](belgique/ehealth/mda-erreurs.md), [Accord "
"refusé](belgique/ehealth/eagreement-refus.md). Voir aussi la [FAQ — "
"Belgique](belgique/faq.md)."

#: ../../content/support.md:39
msgid "2. Open a ticket with LPLG support"
msgstr "2\\. Ouvrir un ticket au support LPLG"

#: ../../content/support.md:41
msgid "If the documentation is not enough, contact our team:"
msgstr "Si la documentation ne suffit pas, contactez notre équipe :"

#: ../../content/support.md:43
msgid ""
"**Email: [support@lplg.eu](mailto:support@lplg.eu)** — each message "
"automatically opens a tracking **ticket**."
msgstr ""
"**E-mail : [support@lplg.eu](mailto:support@lplg.eu)** — chaque message "
"ouvre automatiquement un **ticket** de suivi."

#: ../../content/support.md:45
msgid ""
"The **Support** button at the bottom right of every page brings you here."
msgstr "Le bouton **Support** en bas à droite de chaque page vous amène ici."

#: ../../content/support.md:47
msgid "For a fast reply, please specify"
msgstr "Pour une réponse rapide, précisez"

#: ../../content/support.md:50
msgid "The **name of your facility**."
msgstr "Le **nom de votre établissement**."

#: ../../content/support.md:51
msgid ""
"What you were doing and the **screen** involved — a **screenshot** helps a "
"lot."
msgstr ""
"Ce que vous faisiez et l’**écran** concerné — une **capture d'écran** aide "
"beaucoup."

#: ../../content/support.md:52
msgid "The exact **error message** or **code**."
msgstr "Le **message d'erreur** exact ou le **code**."

#: ../../content/support.md:53
msgid ""
"The billing **period** or the **resident** involved (internal reference)."
msgstr ""
"La **période** de facturation ou le **habitant** concerné (référence "
"interne)."

#: ../../content/support.md:56
msgid "Sensitive data (GDPR)"
msgstr "Données sensibles (RGPD)"

#: ../../content/support.md:59
msgid ""
"Avoid sending a **national identification number** or complete medical data "
"by email unless necessary. An **anonymized screenshot** is usually enough — "
"hide the name and the national identification number."
msgstr ""
"Évitez d'envoyer un **numéro d'identification national** ou des données "
"médicales complètes par e-mail sauf nécessité. Une **capture d'écran "
"anonymisée** suffit le plus souvent — masquez le nom et le numéro "
"d'identification national."

#: ../../content/support.md:64
msgid "Further reading"
msgstr "Pour aller plus loin"

#: ../../content/support.md:66
msgid "[FAQ](faq.md) · [Glossary](glossaire.md)"
msgstr "[FAQ](faq.md) · [Glossaire](glossaire.md)"

#: ../../content/support.md:67
msgid "[Getting started](premiers-pas.md)"
msgstr "[Premiers pas](premiers-pas.md)"

